\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   ''For the Chinese Communist Party, the Winter Olympics are inseparable from the broader political goal of building up the country's national image,'' said David Bandurski, director of the China Media Project, a monitoring organization. Referring to the country's leader, he added: ''This is what Xi Jinping has called 'telling China's story well.'''}
