\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   On Twitter, which is banned in China, Chinese state media outlets and journalists, as well as diplomats, have tried to buff the image of the Games, raving about venues and cooing over the Olympic mascot.}{
