\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   Spicy Panda appears to have a connection with iChongqing, a state media-linked multimedia platform based in Chongqing, a city in central China. The accounts that shared Spicy Panda's posts often did the same with tweets by iChongqing's account. IChongqing did not immediately respond to a request for comment.}
