\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   Even the Games' official mascot, Bing Dwen Dwen, a cuddly panda in a suit of ice, has been the subject of an organized campaign on Twitter, according to Albert Zhang, a researcher at the Australian Strategic Policy Institute's International Cyber Policy Center.}
